      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DASHING SLAY (1) produced a moderate performance last time when sixth at The Meadows over 525m behind Zelda Covilha (30.31) in a Special conditions race. Was in the money prior to that. Her last run is a proven strong form reference. Rates on top in this line up. UTTER MADNESS (5) goes very well here starting 15 times for five wins and five minors. Comes off a (30.62) win last time, scoring by a neck in a Grade 4/5 over 530m at this track. Among the main chances. COMPTON GYPSY (7) boasts a strong record this course with seven wins and four minors from 13 tries. Missed the frame latest (25.90) when fifth over 455m at Murray Bridge in a Grade 3/4/5. Makes strong appeal on best. KISAUNI (4) impressed in his solid 30.59 win last time. Looks an each way chance.",
